    {
      "id": 1001,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "DUB TECHNO FOR THE ROOM (generated by tools/output/cardinal/make.mjs: edit there, not here)\n\nPlays by itself at 120 bpm. The output page drives it on MIDI channel 1:\nStart (MIDI clock out on, Tempo 120, Start) puts bar 1 on the room's downbeat; Stop stops new notes.\nCardinal does not follow MIDI clock ticks: the tempo here is its own 120 bpm.\n\nCC 20 Filter     CC 21 Echo feedback   CC 22 Space (reverb)\nCC 23 Stab decay CC 24 Hats            CC 25 Throw (echo send)\nCC 26 Wobble (filter LFO, 2 bars)\nNote 48 Stab   Note 38 Rim   Note 51 Siren\nNote 36 held: kick off (breakdown) while someone stands in the drop zone\n\nPick the MIDI input in Cardinal's settings (loopMIDI, IAC Driver, ALSA virmidi).\nAll controllers at 0 sound fine: they only add.",
        "width": 24
      },
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
